LOAD_CONST R3 name
LOAD_CONST R4 Alice
HOST_CALL map_new R3 2 R5
LOAD_CONST R6 name
LOAD_CONST R7 Bob
HOST_CALL map_new R6 2 R8
LOAD_CONST R9 0
HOST_CALL array_new R9 1 R10
MOVE R11 R2
